<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Safer To Hate Her</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">You Me At Six</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hold Me Down</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1rs92hJj00BrqjuyroOv6g</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.220" end="00:49.770">Too much, too much is never enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.770" end="00:53.050">I had you and I gave you up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.050" end="00:57.910">No idea where my mind was for months</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.910" end="01:02.670">I woke up, I cashed in all of my luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.670" end="01:05.880">Walked hand and hand with your trust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.880" end="01:09.120">And everybody was kissing on fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:10.810">And we all got burnt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.810" end="01:13.830">It'd be safer to hate her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.830" end="01:17.070">Than to love her and to lose her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.070" end="01:22.830">It'd be safer to hate her all around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.830" end="01:25.450">Caught you having a laugh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.450" end="01:28.190">Did you catch me have the last?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.190" end="01:31.770">I've been smiling like this for days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.770" end="01:36.320">Just to make up for my mistakes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.320" end="01:41.070">In the dark, I watch everyone disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.070" end="01:44.190">And I am beginning to let myself down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.190" end="01:49.110">I am pushing everyone that was in, out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.110" end="01:52.230">It'd be safer to hate her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.230" end="01:55.440">Than to love her and to lose her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.440" end="02:00.690">It'd be safer to hate her all around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.690" end="02:04.970">And nobody knows what it's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.970" end="02:07.970">To live and die on the inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.970" end="02:10.980">Nobody knows what it's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.980" end="02:14.510">To be one of a kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.510" end="02:22.510" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.040" end="02:33.510">When we die, do we feel alive?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.510" end="02:40.690">When we die, do we feel alive?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.690" end="02:46.740" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.740" end="02:49.700">It'd be safer to hate her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.700" end="02:53.020">Than to love her and to lose her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.020" end="02:58.110">It'd be safer to hate her all around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.110" end="03:02.570">And nobody knows what it's like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.570" end="03:04.820">To live and die on the inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.820" end="03:06.320" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.530" end="03:09.530">And nobody knows</p></div></body></tt>